WEBVTT

00:17.183 --> 00:18.893
Hey! Wait! Stop! Stop!

00:25.358 --> 00:26.735
I need to see Mister En!

01:56.324 --> 01:57.992
THE BEGINNING

02:02.622 --> 02:03.456
Caiman...

02:08.962 --> 02:09.796
Hey.

02:10.588 --> 02:12.257
How are you feeling this morning?

02:12.799 --> 02:14.050
Well, so-so.

02:16.344 --> 02:17.720
Noi told us everything.

02:17.804 --> 02:19.264
So, you're nearly dead?

02:19.347 --> 02:20.265
You know Shin,

02:20.348 --> 02:21.933
you don't have to be so blunt.

02:22.475 --> 02:23.309
Yeah.

02:23.393 --> 02:26.729
It's only because this smoke drip
Noi gave me I'm able to hang on.

02:30.441 --> 02:32.944
Look, I know it's not the best
time for this, but-

02:38.825 --> 02:42.787
MY SECRET PLAN

02:46.833 --> 02:47.876
Uh well it's...

02:50.211 --> 02:52.338
It's Ebisu, Ebisu's dead.

02:53.131 --> 02:55.091
Hmm. And?

02:56.551 --> 02:57.677
Well... um...

02:58.595 --> 03:01.014
You know... I was thinking

03:01.931 --> 03:03.349
- That maybe Kikurage...
- Hm?

03:04.434 --> 03:06.811
Er... with Kikurage's magic...

03:08.479 --> 03:09.314
Fujita.

03:09.981 --> 03:11.774
Kikurage isn't my pet.

03:17.322 --> 03:19.407
Kikurage just repeated what I said.

03:19.991 --> 03:22.660
As proof, I've never given her an order.

03:23.995 --> 03:26.164
I just use her nature to my advantage.

03:26.664 --> 03:28.208
Then what am I supposed to do?

03:28.708 --> 03:31.169
I need her magic to be able to
revive Ebisu!

03:32.503 --> 03:35.715
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:37.008 --> 03:39.385
If you try to force her to use her magic,

03:40.178 --> 03:42.180
something terrible will happen.

03:43.223 --> 03:44.641
Something terrible?

03:46.267 --> 03:48.478
IT'S ABOUT TIME FOR MY PATROL.

03:48.978 --> 03:51.773
Guess I need to use her nature to my
advantage...

03:52.815 --> 03:56.319
If I remember correctly, she feels
like reviving people when there's a

03:56.402 --> 03:57.237
corpse nearby.

03:57.320 --> 03:59.822
She was close enough to Ebisu to sleep in
her bed...

04:01.783 --> 04:03.243
LET'S START WITH THIS ROOM.

04:04.786 --> 04:05.995
ALL CLEAR.

04:13.044 --> 04:14.170
Kikurage...

04:16.839 --> 04:17.966
Kikurage...

04:19.175 --> 04:20.760
TH-THAT SMELLS OF DEATH!

04:21.261 --> 04:23.471
Kikurage, wait up!

04:34.107 --> 04:36.067
And also... Look.

04:36.567 --> 04:39.153
It appears like someone dissected it.

04:41.489 --> 04:42.323
I see!

04:42.907 --> 04:45.410
- It's the head from back then!
- Oh...

04:45.493 --> 04:48.329
that's the one I cut off, isn't it?
If I recall,

04:48.413 --> 04:50.248
I made that cut with my hammer.

04:51.791 --> 04:54.877
If that's the case,
what was it doing just lying around?

04:56.045 --> 04:57.964
Well, I don't know about that, but...

04:58.840 --> 05:00.383
There's something else I saw...

05:00.466 --> 05:02.969
Caiman doesn't have a lizard
face anymore.

05:03.052 --> 05:04.137
- Huh?
- Huh?

05:04.804 --> 05:05.638
- Oh...
- Oh...

05:05.722 --> 05:06.556
What?

05:06.639 --> 05:08.474
- Is that true?!
- Uh what's all this?

05:11.978 --> 05:15.064
If that lizard guy's face is back
to normal, that means...

05:15.148 --> 05:17.650
Ebisu must have cast her magic on him.

05:19.193 --> 05:20.194
Did you kill her?

05:20.278 --> 05:21.362
Of course not!

05:21.446 --> 05:24.324
I just want Kikurage to revive her.

05:24.407 --> 05:27.827
Even if you do that, I wonder how the
devil tumor in her head is.

05:27.910 --> 05:28.745
- Huh?
- Fujita,

05:28.828 --> 05:30.163
have him take a look.

05:30.246 --> 05:32.957
His intentions may not be good, but
his skills are.

05:35.793 --> 05:36.794
Her beautiful hair...!

05:36.878 --> 05:39.464
Well you're the one who wrapped
it in duct tape.

05:39.547 --> 05:42.091
Yeah, it looks like it's okay.

05:42.175 --> 05:44.552
Before you revive her and everything,

05:45.094 --> 05:47.138
why don't you have Noi heal the damage?

05:47.221 --> 05:48.723
Yeah, I'll do that.

05:49.724 --> 05:51.309
I can't believe it,

05:51.392 --> 05:55.104
everyone's acting so indifferent
about Ebisu's death.

05:55.897 --> 05:58.858
I wonder if they'd react the same way
if I died?

06:00.360 --> 06:02.070
EEK! YOU AGAIN?!

06:03.279 --> 06:04.572
Isn't Ebisu your friend--

06:06.366 --> 06:08.159
What are you doing, you idiot?

06:08.242 --> 06:11.079
You almost broke my mushroom! Are you
trying to kill me?

06:11.788 --> 06:12.830
Is that Chota?

06:14.290 --> 06:16.501
Sorry, I didn't realize it was you,
Fujita.

06:17.001 --> 06:19.128
After all, I can't see out of this thing.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.922
Th-That must be tough.

06:21.464 --> 06:24.884
But wouldn't it be easy for you to
turn yourself back to normal with

06:24.967 --> 06:25.802
your magic?

06:25.885 --> 06:28.554
That's true, but you know, I like this
mushroom...

06:29.055 --> 06:31.933
It smells so much like En, I love it!

06:32.433 --> 06:34.060
Oh. Well, that's nice...

06:35.311 --> 06:37.188
Speaking of smells, eww what is that?

06:37.855 --> 06:39.816
So... Actually...

06:41.025 --> 06:43.319
I see. So Ebisu is...

06:43.820 --> 06:44.654
Hang on,

06:44.737 --> 06:47.740
I have something to bring her luck.
Poor thing never had much.

06:47.824 --> 06:49.659
Doesn't have much hair now either.

06:49.742 --> 06:50.868
Here it is!

06:50.952 --> 06:53.454
I got this from a devil a long time ago.

06:53.538 --> 06:57.125
They say that if you wear this
hairpin, you can guarantee you'll always

06:57.208 --> 06:59.877
have a big smile on your face.
I'll put it on her.

07:00.586 --> 07:01.421
Done.

07:02.296 --> 07:04.298
It suits you, Ebisu.

07:07.969 --> 07:10.805
Now, where did Kikurage run off to?

07:11.431 --> 07:12.265
Ah!

07:12.348 --> 07:13.182
It's Noi!

07:14.100 --> 07:15.101
Hey Noi!

07:16.310 --> 07:17.145
Right,

07:17.228 --> 07:19.689
let's see if any of you shrooms
can land a punch.

07:39.167 --> 07:40.793
Fujita! Fujita!

07:40.877 --> 07:42.086
Are you okay?

07:43.212 --> 07:44.297
Sorry about that.

07:44.380 --> 07:47.133
I was so into my training that I didn't
notice you.

07:48.342 --> 07:49.177
Hey, wait...

07:49.719 --> 07:50.678
Where's Ebisu?

07:53.347 --> 07:54.682
Did you kill her?

07:54.765 --> 07:56.309
I didn't! I didn't!

07:56.392 --> 07:58.102
You want me to heal her, right?

07:58.186 --> 07:59.187
Huh?

08:03.357 --> 08:05.485
Hey! W-Wait! Wait a minute!

08:05.985 --> 08:09.113
You just healed her while the devil's
hairpin was inside her head!

08:09.197 --> 08:10.156
Really?

08:10.656 --> 08:13.618
Well, if there's anything wrong with
her when she wakes up,

08:13.701 --> 08:16.204
- just bring her back.
- You sure she'll be alright?

08:16.704 --> 08:18.706
At least the rotting smell is gone!

08:19.499 --> 08:22.001
That's more like it, Ebisu. All cleaned
up!

08:23.920 --> 08:24.754
So heavy...

08:25.505 --> 08:27.548
I can't do this much longer...

08:28.174 --> 08:30.593
Oh... There you are, Kikurage!

08:32.428 --> 08:33.638
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:34.430 --> 08:36.390
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN?

08:37.934 --> 08:39.644
LET'S PLAY SOME MORE.

08:41.437 --> 08:42.271
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:42.813 --> 08:43.773
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:44.815 --> 08:46.400
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN...?

08:46.901 --> 08:48.903
THIS WILL MAKE YOU FEEL BETTER.

08:51.197 --> 08:52.448
Stop it!!!

08:56.285 --> 08:58.454
Look! It's a corpse! Bring it back to
life!

09:08.798 --> 09:09.632
I guess,

09:10.508 --> 09:12.093
that was the terrible thing...

09:13.052 --> 09:14.762
EBISU

09:15.846 --> 09:16.681
Oh well,

09:17.265 --> 09:20.560
In the end, I wasn't able to revive Ebisu
today.

09:21.727 --> 09:23.563
I'll try again tomorrow.

09:29.569 --> 09:31.779
HEY LADY, ARE YOU SLEEPING?

09:33.072 --> 09:35.533
WE PROMISED THAT YOU'LL ALWAYS GIVE ME
A SNACK AT THIS TIME.

09:35.616 --> 09:37.535
WAKE UP, LADY! IT'S TIME FOR MY SNACK!

09:46.168 --> 09:47.878
NOW, GIVE ME A SNACK.

09:56.053 --> 09:57.096
Just what the hell...

09:58.973 --> 09:59.974
are you?

10:07.398 --> 10:09.108
I'm having that dream again.

10:09.191 --> 10:10.234
Damn it.

10:10.318 --> 10:12.570
Could it be that I'm scared of something?

10:14.030 --> 10:16.449
Is the Cross-Eyes boss still alive
somehow?

10:17.450 --> 10:19.994
If only I could just use Nikaido's magic...

10:22.121 --> 10:24.248
Gotta stay hydrated.

10:24.832 --> 10:26.000
Oh, Ebisu.

10:27.418 --> 10:29.086
I heard you got a new mask.

10:29.170 --> 10:30.671
It looks good on you.

10:31.255 --> 10:33.174
Not that I can really see you, though.

10:35.551 --> 10:38.721
Uh it looks like the hairpin I gave her
is still inside her head,

10:38.804 --> 10:41.307
and it's made her even crazier than ever...

10:41.390 --> 10:42.725
You're so funny!

10:46.687 --> 10:50.066
Ever since I became a mushroom, I
feel more at ease in dark forests

10:50.149 --> 10:51.400
like this.

10:52.151 --> 10:53.861
Now, let's see the horoscope for Gemini

10:53.944 --> 10:56.447
- sorcerers this month.
- Hey! I'm a Gemini!

10:56.947 --> 10:58.240
Outlook is so-so.

10:58.324 --> 11:02.203
There will be something that makes
you even more fond of the person you've

11:02.286 --> 11:05.414
- been having one-sided feelings toward.
- Hehe, I'm looking forward to that.

11:05.498 --> 11:07.541
Next, let's see the horoscope for
Capricorn sorcerers.

11:07.625 --> 11:08.709
But "so-so", huh?

11:08.793 --> 11:09.877
Oh, that's En.

11:10.586 --> 11:11.420
Very bad.

11:11.504 --> 11:14.840
However, some of the problems you've
left in the past will reach some kind of

11:14.924 --> 11:16.759
- conclusion.
- She said it's "bad".

11:16.842 --> 11:17.968
- Next...
- Poor En.

11:18.469 --> 11:20.346
Let's see the horoscope for Pisces
sorcerers.

11:20.429 --> 11:21.430
But I'm a little worried.

11:21.514 --> 11:23.849
- Good.
- Her fortune-telling is usually spot on.

11:23.933 --> 11:27.103
You will finally see progress on
that goal you've been working-

11:27.812 --> 11:29.980
- Would you like some juice?
- Yes, please!

11:30.064 --> 11:32.608
TERMITE EXTERMINATION

11:32.692 --> 11:35.236
I'm so tired. It might not cost anything

11:36.320 --> 11:38.656
but killing termites with spit is hard
work.

11:41.450 --> 11:43.452
Tetsujo and Ton's medical bills won't pay
themselves.

11:43.536 --> 11:44.453
Hey big bro!

11:44.537 --> 11:46.205
Dokuga, hey, wait up!

11:46.706 --> 11:48.999
Oh, you've got some juice! Give me a
sip--

11:49.083 --> 11:50.292
Stop it. You'll die.

11:51.127 --> 11:53.045
So, how much did you make today?

11:53.546 --> 11:55.381
Six hundred nicks from three houses.

11:55.881 --> 11:58.217
I made eight hundred nicks as a waitress.

11:58.718 --> 12:00.094
Oh, I see...

12:03.264 --> 12:06.308
Dokuga. I talked it over with Ushijimada,

12:06.392 --> 12:09.520
and I think we've got no choice but
to pawn this.

12:09.603 --> 12:12.732
We both looked for work all day. This
is all we made!

12:14.567 --> 12:16.819
There aren't any decent jobs for
people like us.

12:16.902 --> 12:19.196
You have to be a magic user for
everything!

12:19.280 --> 12:20.406
It's as he says.

12:20.948 --> 12:23.159
In order to save Tetsujo and Ton,

12:23.242 --> 12:26.620
we need to get our hands on some
grade-A smoke as soon as possible.

12:28.831 --> 12:30.708
This is the only thing we can't pawn.

12:30.791 --> 12:32.251
You what? But why not?!

12:32.752 --> 12:36.046
Are you willing to let Tetsujo
and Ton die over some damn knife?

12:36.130 --> 12:39.258
If I find out you've been hiding
something from us I'll--

12:40.885 --> 12:41.719
- Hey!
- Listen.

12:42.219 --> 12:45.473
These knives are something that
were entrusted to me by the Boss.

12:45.973 --> 12:47.475
I'll return it to him myself.

12:48.476 --> 12:51.187
I'll also get back everything
we've pawned so far.

12:51.687 --> 12:53.856
And I'll do something about the money.

12:53.939 --> 12:56.192
If you understand, keep your mouth shut.

12:56.692 --> 12:58.444
Yes... I get it.

12:58.527 --> 12:59.737
So if you could just-

13:01.864 --> 13:02.865
Hey, Dokuga!

13:05.451 --> 13:09.246
CROSS-EYE EXPEDITION

13:10.539 --> 13:11.415
Shaitan.

13:11.916 --> 13:15.711
An organization for the few existing heal
and repair-type sorcerers.

13:17.338 --> 13:20.716
They're the ones driving up the price
of repair-type smoke.

13:22.092 --> 13:24.595
With tight security, and plenty
of guards,

13:24.678 --> 13:26.639
it's a hard place to break into.

13:27.306 --> 13:28.224
However...

13:29.391 --> 13:31.769
Every day, they call in women and
have parties.

13:32.728 --> 13:35.272
All right, let's have fun tonight!

13:38.442 --> 13:41.695
The booze is great. Drink up, drink up!

13:41.779 --> 13:44.740
There's a lot more in that jar too.

13:46.408 --> 13:48.786
They're throwing another party
downstairs.

13:49.370 --> 13:51.914
We should get to have some fun once in a
while...

13:53.582 --> 13:55.167
- Would you like some fruit?
- Wow!

13:55.251 --> 13:56.210
Cheers!

13:58.254 --> 13:59.672
That's crazy!

14:00.172 --> 14:01.006
Wow!

14:14.895 --> 14:18.315
Every time a Cross-Eyes is revealed,
it's only matter of time before

14:18.399 --> 14:20.192
En eliminates them.

14:21.026 --> 14:23.946
So we've been quietly waiting for
the boss to return.

14:24.655 --> 14:27.449
- But we can't wait any more.
- Die you little-

14:31.704 --> 14:33.205
A murder without magic.

14:34.456 --> 14:37.626
En is definitely going to hear about
this.

14:40.838 --> 14:41.672
Boss...

14:42.214 --> 14:43.173
Where are you?

14:48.345 --> 14:49.346
Where am I?

14:51.765 --> 14:52.683
It's you...

14:53.767 --> 14:54.602
Who are you?

14:55.769 --> 14:56.729
The name's Aikawa.

14:57.229 --> 14:58.355
Nice to meet you.

14:59.148 --> 15:00.774
BIG BANDAGE MASK SAFE AND SECURE

15:01.275 --> 15:04.278
Good thing I bought a full-sized
bandage mask.

15:06.655 --> 15:08.073
All right, I'm doing it.

15:17.625 --> 15:18.459
Thank you.

15:18.542 --> 15:20.502
It doesn't sting as much anymore.

15:20.586 --> 15:21.670
What's your name?

15:22.171 --> 15:24.506
And why the hell do you look like that?

15:24.590 --> 15:25.633
My name's Asu-

15:26.133 --> 15:28.427
No... I'm Kawajiri.

15:29.011 --> 15:30.054
Don't you remember?

15:30.638 --> 15:33.557
The devil from the basement of the church
in En's mansion.

15:35.100 --> 15:37.561
- What are you talking about?
- Wait...

15:37.645 --> 15:39.730
aren't you the man named Caiman?

15:40.314 --> 15:42.900
You were Nikaido's friend... from back
in Hole?

15:43.651 --> 15:46.528
Nikaido?
I don't know anyone with that name.

15:48.113 --> 15:50.824
It seems I have you mixed up with
someone else.

15:51.617 --> 15:53.077
Anyway, thanks for your help.

15:53.619 --> 15:54.954
I'll be going now.

15:56.664 --> 15:58.123
Going? Hey, wait!

16:04.338 --> 16:06.256
Time to work, you two.

16:07.216 --> 16:09.635
Is it true the Cross-Eyes are on the
move again?

16:09.718 --> 16:10.719
Yeah.

16:11.220 --> 16:15.349
There's a shop in Devas called Shaitan.
Every sorcerer inside was slaughtered.

16:16.141 --> 16:20.354
The footprints suggest there's only
one culprit, and they used a blade.

16:21.563 --> 16:24.483
It might be the work of the Cross-Eyes'
boss.

16:25.150 --> 16:26.402
Make sure you finish him!

16:30.072 --> 16:32.866
Well once again,
our work requires us to part ways,

16:32.950 --> 16:33.826
Kasukabe

16:34.326 --> 16:36.245
Be a good boy while we're gone.

16:36.787 --> 16:37.621
Hey Shin,

16:37.705 --> 16:41.041
I've always wanted to meet a devil.
Do you know how I can do that?

16:41.125 --> 16:42.501
I heard there's a room

16:42.584 --> 16:45.254
somewhere in the mansion built to summon
devils.

16:45.754 --> 16:47.256
Don't do anything stupid!

16:47.756 --> 16:48.590
Got it.

16:48.674 --> 16:49.550
I'll look for it.

16:53.470 --> 16:55.681
What am I so anxious about?

16:56.515 --> 16:59.727
To think I'd send Shin and Noi
before I was even sure it was the

16:59.810 --> 17:01.186
Cross-Eyes...

17:02.855 --> 17:05.858
Why? Why this sense of uneasiness?

17:06.650 --> 17:07.484
Hey En...

17:07.568 --> 17:08.652
let's have some tea!

17:09.737 --> 17:10.571
Tea, huh?

17:13.532 --> 17:16.452
En,
what are you planning to do with Nikaido?

17:16.535 --> 17:19.496
She's gonna die unless you do
something for her soon.

17:20.330 --> 17:22.166
For reasons I can't understand,

17:22.249 --> 17:24.251
Nikaido refuses to use her magic.

17:25.461 --> 17:27.296
I've tried to respect her will

17:27.379 --> 17:28.881
and watch over her...

17:29.840 --> 17:31.175
But I'm at my limit.

17:32.468 --> 17:34.428
I'm going to make her use her magic.

17:34.511 --> 17:36.764
Even if I have to get rough.

17:38.140 --> 17:40.851
Is the Cross-Eyes' boss really dead
or not?

17:41.351 --> 17:42.895
That's what I must confirm!

17:43.687 --> 17:46.523
Six years ago, I used all my magic
to subdue him,

17:47.024 --> 17:48.317
and then...

17:48.817 --> 17:51.028
The town of Mastema was destroyed.

17:51.653 --> 17:55.407
Nobody could have gotten out of there
without turning into a mushroom man.

17:56.158 --> 17:58.535
Even so I know what I saw!

17:59.161 --> 18:00.996
The shadow of a headless man

18:01.538 --> 18:03.832
crawling out of the mushrooms!

18:09.630 --> 18:11.465
- Where are we?
- En's mansion.

18:12.257 --> 18:14.176
So it was your magic that got us here?

18:15.803 --> 18:17.012
Nikaido is up ahead.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.555
Let's go.

18:20.224 --> 18:21.141
Damn it.

18:22.935 --> 18:26.355
So tell me... are you a big-shot
sorcerer or something?

18:26.855 --> 18:29.775
Must be nice to be able to go
anywhere you want.

18:30.734 --> 18:32.820
What kind of magic do you use?

18:34.071 --> 18:34.947
Well, you know...

18:35.531 --> 18:38.075
I can't just tell someone I've
barely met.

18:39.910 --> 18:40.744
Nikaido.

18:42.913 --> 18:44.498
- Who are you?
- Nikaido!

18:44.998 --> 18:46.625
It's me, Asu.

18:47.292 --> 18:50.712
- Asu?
- Chidaruma turned me back into a sorcerer,

18:51.213 --> 18:52.464
and now I look like this.

18:53.549 --> 18:55.092
So that's what happened to you,

18:55.175 --> 18:56.009
Asu.

18:56.635 --> 18:57.469
I hope-

18:57.553 --> 18:59.888
Chidaruma didn't do this because
you helped me.

18:59.972 --> 19:00.806
It's okay.

19:00.889 --> 19:03.058
After all, I did owe you one for
saving me.

19:04.309 --> 19:05.978
You're in rough shape here, huh?

19:07.437 --> 19:09.982
It's because I'm rejecting the
contract with En.

19:10.065 --> 19:11.900
I'm managing to hold on,

19:13.360 --> 19:15.988
But still- I think I'm at my limit.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.657
You wanna get out of here?

19:18.740 --> 19:20.409
With my magic, that's no problem.

19:21.994 --> 19:23.453
- Who is he?
- Oh...

19:23.954 --> 19:25.038
That guy is...

19:25.122 --> 19:26.498
Hey I'm Aikawa.

19:26.999 --> 19:29.751
I have nothing to do with this, but he
brought me here.

19:30.836 --> 19:31.753
I know that voice...

19:32.546 --> 19:35.757
I'm sorry, but could you take off
that mask and show me your face?

19:35.841 --> 19:36.675
Huh?

19:36.758 --> 19:38.051
Wh-What for?

19:38.594 --> 19:40.137
How come you can't take it off?

19:40.220 --> 19:42.598
- It's not a big deal, right?
- Nikaido?

19:42.681 --> 19:43.807
You know what...

19:43.891 --> 19:45.642
I'm gonna get out of here.

19:46.310 --> 19:47.144
Caiman!

19:50.314 --> 19:51.899
I don't know who that is.

19:52.900 --> 19:54.568
I'll make you take off that mask!

20:01.408 --> 20:02.284
Stop it!

20:06.580 --> 20:09.333
Huh? See? You should knock this off--

20:10.626 --> 20:11.627
Oh, no--

20:13.587 --> 20:14.421
Gotcha!

20:16.715 --> 20:17.966
N-Nikaido!

20:25.224 --> 20:26.058
Caiman...

20:32.022 --> 20:33.690
Are you happy now?

20:36.026 --> 20:38.904
Oh man,
you're one violent girl, aren't you?

20:40.072 --> 20:41.323
Cai... man...?

20:47.079 --> 20:47.955
See you later.

20:50.040 --> 20:50.874
Huh?

21:02.719 --> 21:03.637
Nikaido.

21:04.680 --> 21:07.224
Was that man really Caiman after all?

21:08.141 --> 21:08.976
I don't know.

21:10.269 --> 21:11.561
Should we go after him?

21:12.521 --> 21:13.355
Yeah.

21:18.944 --> 21:20.821
Nikaido, Nikai--

21:22.572 --> 21:24.116
Oh no, the drip-feed!

21:24.616 --> 21:25.826
Nikaido!

21:29.371 --> 21:31.456
I'm getting headaches again.

21:37.879 --> 21:39.339
I found him.

21:43.176 --> 21:45.929
You've been laughing ever since you
came back to life.

21:47.222 --> 21:50.267
You better not laugh when we go
to Mister En's place.

21:50.976 --> 21:54.938
We're gonna ask him to let you stay
at the mansion. You gotta shape up!

21:56.231 --> 21:58.233
From here on out, you're all on your own.

21:58.317 --> 21:59.484
Do you understand?

22:10.454 --> 22:11.288
You idiot!

22:14.958 --> 22:16.376
- Oh...
- W-What the-?

22:16.877 --> 22:17.711
Whoa!

22:20.547 --> 22:22.299
What is this? I feel sick.

22:22.799 --> 22:23.884
It's like-

22:33.393 --> 22:35.645
I'm making Nikaido use her magic today!

22:35.729 --> 22:37.606
I can't hold back anymore.

22:37.689 --> 22:38.648
Hm?

22:38.732 --> 22:39.775
Kikurage.

22:40.359 --> 22:41.234
Come here.

22:42.402 --> 22:43.236
Kikurage?

22:44.196 --> 22:45.197
The security device...

22:45.739 --> 22:47.657
And she's terrified.

22:49.659 --> 22:51.828
What's happening? Suddenly I feel sick.

22:51.912 --> 22:53.955
DEFORMED REUNION

23:06.176 --> 23:07.010
You...

23:13.975 --> 23:14.976
I knew it,

23:15.811 --> 23:17.270
You were alive!

23:21.817 --> 23:22.651
Huh?!

23:22.734 --> 23:24.694
Take care of Kikurage, go now!

23:24.778 --> 23:25.779
En...

23:25.862 --> 23:26.696
En!

23:29.825 --> 23:30.659
En!

23:41.211 --> 23:42.671
It's just like six years ago.

23:43.171 --> 23:44.089
I'm getting dizzy.

23:44.589 --> 23:46.425
My body is throbbing in pain.

23:46.967 --> 23:48.802
This will be over in an instant.

24:03.150 --> 24:05.986
I'll end this with my own hands.

24:13.827 --> 24:15.370
Blow smoke out now!

24:15.871 --> 24:16.705
En!

24:35.015 --> 24:35.849
En!

24:36.808 --> 24:39.144
How long is this mushroom gonna fly?

24:39.853 --> 24:41.855
Huh? I'm back to normal?

24:42.439 --> 24:44.524
Huh? Why?

24:46.943 --> 24:48.111
No... No way...

24:48.612 --> 24:49.946
It can't be...

24:50.655 --> 24:51.490
En!

24:52.032 --> 24:52.866
En!

24:56.286 --> 24:58.622
A headless man, it's gotta be-

25:04.002 --> 25:04.836
Huh?

26:41.641 --> 26:42.934
THE END

26:43.018 --> 26:44.811
What we learned in Episode 19.

26:45.312 --> 26:47.147
Fujita's love for Ebisu is real.

26:47.230 --> 26:49.024
Chota's ever-changing head.

26:49.107 --> 26:50.817
The boss's overwhelming strength.

26:50.900 --> 26:51.735
En...!

26:52.319 --> 26:54.321
What we're going to learn in Episode 20.

26:54.404 --> 26:55.947
It's still... lost in chaos.

26:56.031 --> 26:57.866
This is... Dorohedoro!
